{"name": "Monday Meltdown", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512160/extras/5a0f203bdfc3f3c1b08fe2df1b8306ca.poster.avif?t=1770664578\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512160/extras/5a0f203bdfc3f3c1b08fe2df1b8306ca.webm?t=1770664578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512160/extras/5a0f203bdfc3f3c1b08fe2df1b8306ca.mp4?t=1770664578\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It's time for a Monday Meltdown. A solo-developed, super-fast 8-player top-down shooter built for one thing: <strong>dominating</strong> <strong>your</strong> <strong>friends</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Inspired by classics like <i>Hotline Miami</i> and <i>Soldat</i>, and spiced up with plenty of gore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"98\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512160/extras/04daf791e7d2decdd5124843b61f690d.avif?t=1770664578\" width=\"600\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512160/extras/4cacb15c5192f282df4fd774f5ccb662.poster.avif?t=1770664578\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512160/extras/4cacb15c5192f282df4fd774f5ccb662.webm?t=1770664578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512160/extras/4cacb15c5192f282df4fd774f5ccb662.mp4?t=1770664578\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dominate</strong> your <strong>friends</strong> or foes in a variety of fast-paced gamemodes. Host or join a match and you're straight into the action\u2014no waiting around. Got no friends? Bots are supported.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"98\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512160/extras/29f6f22cc2ec5be59c2facb5c15fa74b.avif?t=1770664578\" width=\"600\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512160/extras/1a7b01f634757b1f4cf42f8b328a9d16.poster.avif?t=1770664578\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512160/extras/1a7b01f634757b1f4cf42f8b328a9d16.webm?t=1770664578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512160/extras/1a7b01f634757b1f4cf42f8b328a9d16.mp4?t=1770664578\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Equip yourself with a wide range of <strong>weapons</strong>\u00a0that all serve a specific purpose -\u00a0<strong>Good</strong> <strong>plays</strong> win the game, not just the gear you're holding</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you're on a killing-spree,<strong> killstreak</strong>\u00a0weapons will be awarded ensuring chaos unfolds</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512160/extras_big/b3a6910a2037286e9a71002d82abca1e.webp?t=1770664578\" height=\"254\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512160/extras/b3a6910a2037286e9a71002d82abca1e.avif?t=1770664578\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512160/extras/88dbc4e648f8727e84b82610ef4fd029.poster.avif?t=1770664578\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512160/extras/88dbc4e648f8727e84b82610ef4fd029.webm?t=1770664578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512160/extras/88dbc4e648f8727e84b82610ef4fd029.mp4?t=1770664578\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Winning is cool, but winning with <strong>style</strong> is better. Unlock new character and weapon skins to look good doing it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Add salt with <strong>taunts and custom killphrases</strong>, or hunt for <strong>cool in-game secrets</strong> to unlock exclusive skins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Are your ready to melt some Mondays?</strong></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Fast. Bloody. 8-Player Mayhem. Dominate. Taunt. Repeat. Free. No strings attached. Ever.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512160/header.jpg?t=1770664578", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Action", "Shooter", "Arena Shooter", "Bullet Hell", "Shoot 'Em Up", "Top-Down Shooter"], "developers": "NF Mynster", "publishers": "NF Mynster", "release_date": "Feb 9, 2026", "price": "Free To Play", "appid": "2512160", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "9 February 2026 - Free To Play", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/jJliTItdTTg", "first_seen": 1770591600.0, "review_rank": 1251}